<title>USA: Raytheon E-Systems wins $10 mln Army order.</title>
<headline>Raytheon E-Systems wins $10 mln Army order.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, Texas 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytheon Co said the U.S. Army has ordered an additional 950 high-mobility trailers under an existing contract with Raytheon E-Systems, bringing the total number of trailers ordered over four years to 4,300.</p>
<p>The company said the $10 million option on the additional trailers follows successful completion of extensive testing. The high-mobility trailer is the Army's approved cargo trailer for the high-mobility multipurpose wheeled vehicle.</p>
</text>
